        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: VfB Stuttgart, FC Köln\n- Events: 1953–54 DFB-Pokal final\n- Competitions: DFB-Pokal, German national championship, UEFA Intertoto Cup\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1953–54 DFB-Pokal final, VfB Stuttgart defeated FC Köln 1–0 after extra time.\n- VfB Stuttgart has won the DFB-Pokal three times.\n- VfB Stuttgart has won the German national championship five times, most recently in 2006–07.\n- VfB Stuttgart has won the UEFA Intertoto Cup a record three times.",
